{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-254", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/254", "wordCount": 1211, "segments": [{"start": 13.0, "text": "Good morning everyone."}, {"start": 16.0, "text": "Good morning."}, {"start": 17.0, "text": "My name is Jordyn Castor and"}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "I work here at Apple on the"}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "Accessibility Design and Quality"}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "Team. I'm so excited to be here today."}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "Accessibility is built into our"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "hardware and software design"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "here at Apple."}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "We believe accessibility is a"}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "human right and it's one of our"}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "core values."}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "When I download an app, there's"}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "an expectation that it just"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "works."}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "And I'm able to access all of"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "the buttons, controls, and"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "information using VoiceOver."}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "To be honest, I give an app a"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "first 30 second glance and if I"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "can't access any of the"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "functionality, I delete it."}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "Now, I really, really want to"}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "use your applications."}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "I do. But, one of the most"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "crucial aspects to our built-in"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "features like VoiceOver, Speak"}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "Screen, and Voice Control being"}, {"start": 80.0, "text": "able to access the functionality"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "of your app is by the labeling"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "of your buttons, and text"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "fields, controls, and other"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "elements."}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "So today, I'm going to talk to"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "you about what an accessibility"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "label is, understanding the"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "context for writing great"}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "labels, and best practices."}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "So, let's -- so what is an"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "accessibility label?"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "Well, the definition is pretty"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "short. It's a localized string that"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "succinctly identifies the"}, {"start": 119.0, "text": "accessibility element."}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "But let's unpack that a bit."}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "Identifies the accessibility"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "element."}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "What does that mean exactly?"}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "It's a human readable, human"}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "understandable label that gives"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "context and meaning for the"}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "elements in your app."}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "And writing the code is pretty"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "simple too."}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "It's just getting or setting a"}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "string."}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "But I get it."}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "It's actually pretty difficult"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "to accurately label the elements"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "in your app."}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "And as it turns out, that's all"}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "about the context."}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "So that's what I'm going to help"}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "you understand in the next few"}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "minutes, is the importance of"}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "understanding context."}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "So, let's dive right in."}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "What should the label of this"}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "button be in your app?"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "Well, by default it might be"}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "called plus."}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "And I might be able to figure"}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "out what you meant."}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "But, let's look at that with a"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "bit more context."}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "What about in a nav bar across"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "from a back button?"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "This is pretty common in iOS"}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "apps."}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "What should the label of this"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "button be here?"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "Add? Well, that might be just"}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "dandy."}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "If I'm in a notes app and I hear"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "the word add, I'm going to know"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "that that's going to add a new"}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "note."}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "But remember, these labels are"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "supposed to be succinct."}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "In a shopping context I might"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "need to clarify that a bit"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "further to distinguish this app"}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "button from other actions like"}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "Add to Favorites."}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "So, we might need to call that"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "Add to Cart."}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "And, what if there were dozens"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "of Add to Cart buttons?"}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "In this context I might expect"}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "VoiceOver to say, add peanut"}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "butter to cart."}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "And hopefully it's not crunchy"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "peanut butter."}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "To bring it back to the original"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "example, what should the label"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "of this button be in your app?"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "Well, that all depends on the"}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "context."}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "So, now let's talk about some"}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "best practices when considering"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "what a label should be."}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "First and foremost, always,"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "always remember to add labels to"}, {"start": 278.0, "text": "your apps."}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "This is crucial."}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "If a label's not added,"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "VoiceOver might speak something"}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "like."}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "Button, button, button."}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "And for all I know guys, that"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "could be the Delete hard drive"}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "Partition button and I wouldn't"}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "want to press that."}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "If there is no label added and"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "if there's an image in the"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "button or if there's an image"}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "within the button, VoiceOver"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "might speak something like --"}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "Plus underscore icon"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "underscore outline underscore"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "hash nine, nine, nine, nine,"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "nine, nine, dot."}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "What? What does that even"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "mean?"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "So please, please guys, add"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "labels."}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "VoiceOver knows what the element"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "in your apps is based on the"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "element type."}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "So, it's redundant to add text"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "to your string like button or"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "tab. And if you do, VoiceOver would"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "read out the label like --"}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "Add button button."}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "Hearing this though --"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "Add button."}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "Makes much more sense."}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "Remember to update the label"}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "when the UI changes."}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "So, if you have an add button --"}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "Add button."}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "That changes to a delete"}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "button --"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "Delete button."}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "Remember to update your UI so"}, {"start": 361.0, "text": "that the label, so that"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "VoiceOver will speak the correct"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "state of the button."}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "When there's multiple buttons"}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "with the same action like adding"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "an item to the cart, remember to"}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "provide the context."}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "Here it's not clear what I'm"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "adding."}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "Add button."}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "Am I adding the peanut"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "butter, the bananas, or the"}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "cookies?"}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "Oh, I love cookies."}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "The context is much more clear"}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "here."}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "Add peanut butter button."}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "Oh, we're adding the peanut"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "butter."}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "Hopefully it's not crunchy."}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "Avoid redundant labels."}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "So, if I'm in a music player the"}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "context is clear that we're"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "dealing with songs."}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "So, having VoiceOver speak --"}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "Play song button."}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "Or next song, is unnecessary."}, {"start": 421.0, "text": "I'd much rather hear VoiceOver"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "speak --"}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "Play button."}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "Just the word play."}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "It's also great to add labels to"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "your animations, such as your"}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "spinners."}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "So that VoiceOver will let me"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "know that the content in your"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "app is --"}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "Loading."}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "Loading."}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "That's really important."}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "So, this --"}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "Delete items from the current"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "folder and add it to the trash"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "button."}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "That is too verbose."}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "Remember, we want these labels"}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "to be as succinct as possible."}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "And, the context really makes"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "things in your app clear."}, {"start": 461.0, "text": "So, this --"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "Delete button."}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "Would be just fine."}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "But verbosity isn't always a bad"}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "thing though."}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "Oftentimes verbose descriptions"}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "when in appropriate situations"}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "is really what makes your app"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "fun and memorable."}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "The developers of the Cookie"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "Monster sticker packs have added"}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "verbose but really fun labels to"}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "their stickers."}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "So now, VoiceOver speaks --"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "Me happy face eat small"}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "cookie, om nom nom button."}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "I love that."}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "That is so awesome."}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "These Cookie Monster stickers"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "are intended to be fun and just"}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "make a person smile."}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "Whether you can see the sticker"}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "or you hear the label."}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "So, let's review."}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "Remember to add labels so that"}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "VoiceOver doesn't speak \"button,"}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "button, button.\""}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "Don't include the element type"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "in your label because VoiceOver"}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "gathers that info already."}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "So, hearing add button button is"}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "unnecessary."}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "Update the labels when your UI"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "changes."}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "So, when you have that add"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "button that changes to a delete"}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "button, remember to update your"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "label so VoiceOver reads the"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "correct state of the button."}, {"start": 545.0, "text": "Avoid redundancy like play song,"}, {"start": 549.0, "text": "next song, previous song."}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "In a music player, remember to"}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "provide enough context so I know"}, {"start": 556.0, "text": "whether I'm adding peanut"}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "butter, bananas, or those"}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "awesome cookies to my cart."}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "Add labels to your meaningful"}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "animations like spinners, so"}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "that VoiceOver will read that"}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "the content in your app is"}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "loading or in progress."}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "Avoid verbose labels like delete"}, {"start": 579.0, "text": "current item from the trash and"}, {"start": 581.0, "text": "move it."}, {"start": 582.0, "text": "Unless you have a great reason"}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "like those awesome Cookie"}, {"start": 585.0, "text": "Monster stickers."}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "I really hope you've enjoyed"}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "learning about best practices"}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "for labeling your apps."}, {"start": 595.0, "text": "But if you're ever curious what"}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "your app would sound like to a"}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "VoiceOver user, I really"}, {"start": 601.0, "text": "encourage you to turn it on and"}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "swipe around."}, {"start": 604.0, "text": "It's really a great opportunity"}, {"start": 607.0, "text": "to improve your app for"}, {"start": 608.0, "text": "everyone."}]}
